<section id="Testimonials" class="py-5"> <div class="container"> <h2 class="price-title mb-5">Our <span style="color: #0066CC;">Clients</span></h2> <div class="owl-carousel owl-theme" id="owlour">  <div class="item"> <div class="testimonial-card"> <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch"> <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2 mb-3"> <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.1069 24V15.9657C14.1069 11.5708 14.8702 7.96566 16.3969 5.15021C17.9847 2.33476 20.5191 0.618026 24 0V4.22317C21.9237 4.49785 20.458 5.39055 19.6031 6.90128C18.7481 8.41201 18.3206 10.8154 18.3206 14.1116L15.5725 13.6996H23.9084V24H14.1069ZM0 24V15.9657C0 11.5708 0.763358 7.96566 2.29008 5.15021C3.87786 2.33476 6.41221 0.618026 9.89313 0V4.22317C7.81679 4.49785 6.35114 5.39055 5.49618 6.90128C4.64122 8.41201 4.21374 10.8154 4.21374 14.1116L1.46565 13.6996H9.80153V24H0Z" fill="#0066CC"> </svg> </div> <div class="col-lg-6"> <div class="brand-mini"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Logo%20kh%C3%A1ch%20h%C3%A0ng%20theo%20gi%E1%BA%A3i%20ph%C3%A1p/RA/BIDV%20Logo.png" alt="Client photo"> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-7"> <div class="testimonial-copy h-100"> <p class="quote mb-4 pr-5"> Following the initial second party opinion (SPO), we successfully issued VND 2,500 billion in green bonds and VND 3,000 billion in sustainability bonds in accordance with ICMA standards. Notably, BIDV’s Green Bond Allocation Report underwent an independent assessment by FiinRatings, confirming that the project selection and allocation of green bond proceeds fully complied with the guidelines outlined in the Green Bond Framework. </p> <div class="client mt-4"> <div class="name h5 mb-1">Mr. Long Tran</div> <div class="role">Deputy CEO of BIDV</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-5"> <div class="testimonial-media"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Case%20study/bidv.png" alt="Client photo" class="img"> <img src="/Data/Banner/icon_our2.svg" width="56" height="63" alt="photo" class="imgbotton"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <div class="item"> <div class="testimonial-card"> <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch"> <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2 mb-3"> <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.1069 24V15.9657C14.1069 11.5708 14.8702 7.96566 16.3969 5.15021C17.9847 2.33476 20.5191 0.618026 24 0V4.22317C21.9237 4.49785 20.458 5.39055 19.6031 6.90128C18.7481 8.41201 18.3206 10.8154 18.3206 14.1116L15.5725 13.6996H23.9084V24H14.1069ZM0 24V15.9657C0 11.5708 0.763358 7.96566 2.29008 5.15021C3.87786 2.33476 6.41221 0.618026 9.89313 0V4.22317C7.81679 4.49785 6.35114 5.39055 5.49618 6.90128C4.64122 8.41201 4.21374 10.8154 4.21374 14.1116L1.46565 13.6996H9.80153V24H0Z" fill="#0066CC"> </svg> </div> <div class="col-lg-6"> <div class="brand-mini"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Logo%20kh%C3%A1ch%20h%C3%A0ng%20theo%20gi%E1%BA%A3i%20ph%C3%A1p/RA/Biwase.png" alt="Client photo"> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-7"> <div class="testimonial-copy h-100"> <p class="quote mb-4 pr-5"> The successful issuance of the VND 700 billion AAA-rated bond is a significant milestone in BIWASE Long An’s development, reaffirming company’s financial strength and commitment to sustainability. This achievement strengthens investor confidence and opens avenues for long-term capital mobilization to support clean water infrastructure and service.  </p> <div class="client mt-4"> <div class="name h5 mb-1">Mr. Duc Tan Tran</div> <div class="role">Deputy General Director of BIWASE</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-5"> <div class="testimonial-media"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Case%20study/biwase.png" alt="Client photo" class="img"> <img src="/Data/Banner/icon_our2.svg" width="56" height="63" alt="photo" class="imgbotton"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <div class="item"> <div class="testimonial-card"> <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch"> <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2 mb-3"> <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M14.1069 24V15.9657C14.1069 11.5708 14.8702 7.96566 16.3969 5.15021C17.9847 2.33476 20.5191 0.618026 24 0V4.22317C21.9237 4.49785 20.458 5.39055 19.6031 6.90128C18.7481 8.41201 18.3206 10.8154 18.3206 14.1116L15.5725 13.6996H23.9084V24H14.1069ZM0 24V15.9657C0 11.5708 0.763358 7.96566 2.29008 5.15021C3.87786 2.33476 6.41221 0.618026 9.89313 0V4.22317C7.81679 4.49785 6.35114 5.39055 5.49618 6.90128C4.64122 8.41201 4.21374 10.8154 4.21374 14.1116L1.46565 13.6996H9.80153V24H0Z" fill="#0066CC"> </svg> </div> <div class="col-lg-6"> <div class="brand-mini"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Logo%20kh%C3%A1ch%20h%C3%A0ng%20theo%20gi%E1%BA%A3i%20ph%C3%A1p/RA/Homecredit.png" alt="Client photo"> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-7"> <div class="testimonial-copy h-100"> <p class="quote mb-4 pr-5"> The “A” rating with a stable outlook from FiinRatings - a strategic partner of S&P Global - reflects Home Credit Viet Nam’s journey to create sustainable and profitable growth. Thanks to the foundation of a solid balance sheet and best in class risk and data management, Home Credit Vietnam achieved its growth targets in 2024. </p> <div class="client mt-4"> <div class="name h5 mb-1">Mr. Pham Ngoc Khang</div> <div class="role">General Director of Home Credit Vietnam</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-5"> <div class="testimonial-media"> <img src="/Data/%E1%BA%A3nh%20s%E1%BA%A3n%20ph%E1%BA%A9m/Case%20study/homecredit.png" alt="Client photo" class="img"> <img src="/Data/Banner/icon_our2.svg" width="56" height="63" alt="photo" class="imgbotton"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </div> </div> <div class="clearfix mb-5"></div></section>');
