                        <div class="member-title">Board Member</div>
                        <div class="member-desc">
                            He has over 30 years of experience in Asia–Pacific capital markets, credit ratings, and strategy development. He led the establishment of S&P Global (China) Ratings and currently serves on the Boards of TRIS Ratings (Thailand), Taiwan Ratings Corp., RAM Holdings (Malaysia), and PEFINDO (Indonesia).
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="member-card">
                    <img src="/Data/2025/FR/Doi-ngu-nhan-su/Sarat.png" alt="why" />
                    <div class="member-info">
