                            He is a seasoned strategy leader with substantial experience in international financial services and credit ratings. He previously served as Chief of Staff to the CEO at CRISIL and held various senior leadership roles at S&P Global Ratings. He was a member of the APAC Executive Committee.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="member-card">
                    <img src="/Data/Banner/about_us2.png" alt="why" />
                    <div class="member-info">
