                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="member-card">
                    <img src="/Data/Banner/about_us8.png" alt="why" />
                    <div class="member-info">
                        <div class="member-name">Vu Thi Hoan</div>
                        <div class="member-title">Board Member</div>
                        <div class="member-desc">
                            As a financial manager, making and analyzing financial plans of FiinGroup and FiinRatings, Ms. Hoan has been dedicated to the company since the early days of its establishment. She always ensures that the financial apparatus operates smoothly, helping FiinGroup and FiinRatings keep afloat in the market.
