                        <div class="member-desc">
                            He has served as General Secretary of the Vietnam Bond Market Association (VBMA) since 2009. He also holds independent, non-executive board positions at several enterprises. Previously, he served as Deputy General Director of SOVICO Group, Chairman of HDCAPITAL Fund Management Company (2022–2023), and Chief Executive Officer of VNDirect Securities (2020–2022). Earlier in his career, he spent many years at the head office of BIDV, where he served as Head of  Treasury and Capital Markets.
